If you create a public language or community version, retain the required attribution in [`NOTICE.md`](NOTICE.md), identify that it is a modified version, make its core communication-support route genuinely available without a paywall to people who cannot pay, and state your own hosting, privacy, support, and accessibility boundaries clearly. Hosting, AI compute, legal compliance, security review, and support may still have real costs; a deployer remains responsible for its own service.
